# LaunchDek Project Rules

Self-hosted WordPress master hub for agencies — govern, configure, and automate remote client sites via Application Passwords and core REST APIs. Core checklist API steps need no child plugin; an optional client admin checklist panel is auto-deployed as a must-use plugin when sites connect. PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.0+, GPL-3.0.

See `launchdek-standards.mdc` (quality), `launchdek-compliance.mdc` (security gate), `wordpress-php.mdc` (PHP/REST/DB), `admin-assets.mdc` (JS/CSS).

