## Integrations

Implement `LAUNCHDEK_Integration_Interface` in `includes/integrations/`, register in `LAUNCHDEK_Integrations::get_all()`. Current: MainWP, ManageWP, WP Umbrella, WP Engine, WPvibe. Display names use `* Connector` suffix (translatable).

Integrations admin page (`launchdek-integrations-page.php`) has two sections:
- **Platform Connectors Hub** — connector list with Connected/Not Detected badge + Setup modal (Push Agent, docs link).
- **Telemetry Sync Mapping Rules** — table of platform → LaunchDek field mappings; enabled state saved via REST.

`LAUNCHDEK_Integrations` helpers: `get_statuses()`, `get_launchdek_fields()`, `get_default_telemetry_rules()`, `get_telemetry_rules()`, `save_telemetry_rules()`. Rules persist in `launchdek_settings.telemetry_sync_rules` (id + enabled only; defaults are code-defined).

Integration REST routes require `MANAGE_SETTINGS` (`can_manage_settings`).

## Naming

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Constants | `LAUNCHDEK_*` | `LAUNCHDEK_VERSION`, `LAUNCHDEK_REST_NAMESPACE` |
| Classes | `LAUNCHDEK_{Name}` | `LAUNCHDEK_Site_Repository` |
| Functions | `launchdek_{action}` | `launchdek_run_plugin()` |
| Options | `launchdek_{key}` | `launchdek_settings`, `launchdek_db_version`, `launchdek_dashboard_cache` |
| CSS/JS handles | `launchdek-{name}` | `launchdek-admin` |
| CSS classes | `launchdek-*` | `launchdek-card`, `launchdek-stats-grid` |
| JS global | `launchdekAdmin` | REST URL, nonce, strings |
| Cron hook | `launchdek_drift_verify_cron` | twicedaily drift checks |

`LAUNCHDEK_TEXT_DOMAIN` must match `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_SLUG` (`launchdek`).

## Extension Hooks

- `launchdek_settings_defaults`, `launchdek_settings_sanitize`

## Scope & Change Discipline

- Minimize diff scope; match existing class-based layout.
- Add `index.php` silence files when creating new directories.
- Update `readme.txt` changelog for user-facing changes.
- New repositories/integrations follow existing `class-launchdek-*` naming.

