`LAUNCHDEK_VERSION`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_FILE`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_DIR`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_URL`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_BASENAME`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_SLUG`, `LAUNCHDEK_TEXT_DOMAIN`, `LAUNCHDEK_PLUGIN_DOCS_URL`, `LAUNCHDEK_REST_NAMESPACE`
